1
00:00:00,281 --> 00:00:02,066
Saat dua gedung tinggi dibangun

2
00:00:02,066 --> 00:00:04,248
berdampingan, kenapa di antaranya

3
00:00:04,248 --> 00:00:06,628
disisakan celah tertutup pelat lipat?

4
00:00:07,122 --> 00:00:08,617
Ketika gempa mengguncang,

5
00:00:08,617 --> 00:00:10,416
gedung rendah kaku dan menara

6
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:12,603
tinggi lentur mengayun dengan irama

7
00:00:12,603 --> 00:00:13,129
berbeda.

8
00:00:13,523 --> 00:00:15,500
Jika dindingnya menempel rapat,

9
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,507
keduanya akan saling menghantam

10
00:00:17,507 --> 00:00:19,366
keras—disebut seismic pounding.

11
00:00:19,881 --> 00:00:22,444
Insinyur menghitung jarak celah

12
00:00:22,444 --> 00:00:25,120
pemisah gempa agar puncak kedua

13
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,343
gedung bebas mengayun aman.

14
00:00:27,345 --> 00:00:28,548
Di lorong penghubung,

15
00:00:28,548 --> 00:00:30,953
celah itu ditutup sambungan akordeon

16
00:00:30,953 --> 00:00:32,700
fleksibel yang ikut bergeser.

17
00:00:32,915 --> 00:00:35,950
Batasnya, lebar celah dihitung menurut

18
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:38,092
tinggi gedung dan zona gempa

19
00:00:38,092 --> 00:00:39,449
pada standar SNI 1726.

20
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,782
Pernah injak pelat celah ini

21
00:00:41,782 --> 00:00:42,158
di mal?

22
00:00:42,158 --> 00:00:43,286
Tulis di komentar,

23
00:00:43,286 --> 00:00:44,964
lalu tekan tombol putih di

24
00:00:44,964 --> 00:00:46,497
bawah agar dapat hal yang

25
00:00:46,497 --> 00:00:47,278
gak disangka!

